message: "If you use Football Performance Dynamics Bench in research, please cite this software and credit any upstream datasets separately."
type: software
title: "Football Performance Dynamics Bench"
abstract: "Open research software for inspectable football-performance benchmark definitions, physical trajectory evaluation, source/measurement protocols, and reproducible public research aggregates. The published four-match findings are descriptive and the protected population remains not qualified."
